      <section class="section-faq">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="faq-wrapper">
            <div class="left_side-faq">
              <div class="header-faq">
                <div class="text_heading-faq">
                  <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60 center-small">Frequently asked questions</div>
                  <div class="max-w-400">
                    <h2 class="h2 center-small"><span class="span">Questions</span> startup companies ask us most often</h2>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80 center-small">We want to make sure you feel confident that our service is right for you. Here we’ve looked to address some commonly asked questions. If you have any more specific questions, don’t hesitate to get in touch with a member of the team.</p>
              </div><img src="/images/Frame-1707478606_4.avif" loading="lazy" alt="An abstract digital interface featuring a dark theme with various input fields, a progress bar, and a question mark icon, suggesting a user-friendly design for a software application." class="image-faq">
            </div>
            <div class="right_side-faq">
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e149e" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How fast can you deliver YC startup projects? </p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a2" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Speed is critical for YC startups. During the YC S25 batch, we worked on <a href="/customer-stories/y-combinator" class="link">over half a dozen YC projects</a> simultaneously, including Rimba, Nixo, Hera, Finto, and many more. Each project had the same “demo day” deadline, and we delivered every video within two weeks without sacrificing quality. Typical timelines for other projects range from 1–3 weeks depending on complexity, with options for urgent turnarounds.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14a7" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How do you keep costs within a startup’s budget, especially for YC companies just starting out?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14ab" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We maximize efficiency by leveraging our large asset library from past projects, adapting and tweaking existing assets to fit a startup’s branding. Our robust workflow ensures no time is wasted, making the most of every resource. For projects that allow it, we also utilize AI for voiceovers and video generation, further reducing costs while maintaining high-quality output.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b0" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What experience does Motion The Agency have working with startups?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b4" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We have extensive experience supporting startups at all stages. From early-stage YC S25 companies like Rimba, Nixo, and Finto, to VC-backed startups scaling into mid-market companies like Asset-Map, we understand the fast-moving needs, tight timelines, and resource constraints that startups face.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14b9" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can YC startups see a sample before committing</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14bd" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes, they can. In fact, Finto, one of the first <a href="/customer-stories/y-combinator" class="link">YC companies</a> we worked with last year, started with a sample project before moving into a full partnership. This allows startups to see our quality, workflow, and approach before making any commitment.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cb" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">What level of creative involvement will you have?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="6dd9978b-777b-d69a-c86a-2452fc7e14cf" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">We can handle everything from A–Z in motion design and web design, but our involvement depends on what the company needs. Since startup teams are usually busy developing products, we often take care of the full process — from scripting to the finished video — ensuring the final output aligns perfectly with product messaging and launch goals.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">Can Motion The Agency help with startup pitch videos for investors?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="a5e68325-82bd-dd06-740c-4afa8b8e1e14" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Yes — Motion The Agency creates investor pitch videos that clearly communicate a startup’s vision, product, and market opportunity. We helped <a href="/customer-stories/tasknet" class="link">TaskNet</a> produce a video used as their pitch opener and worked with <a href="/customer-stories/luniate" class="link">Luniate</a> on both the pitch video and refining their deck for maximum impact.</p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
              <div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown-faq w-dropdown">
                <div class="dropdown-top w-dropdown-toggle">
                  <p class="text-14-150">How much does a startup explainer video cost?</p>
                  <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="ic-plus-faq" data-w-id="28228e2b-f56d-3444-a578-e5890aadcb06" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/62581cacf7654a9838775673/62581cacf7654a49f0775692_plus.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager"></div>
                </div>
                <nav class="dropdown-list-faq w-dropdown-list">
                  <div class="wrapper-text-faq">
                    <p class="text-14-150 opacity-80">Pricing starts at $3,480 for a 30-second Basic animation, with Premium and Enhanced packages for more complex videos. All packages include a <a href="/get-free-sample" class="link">free video sample</a>, and you can check our <a href="/pricing/motion-graphics-price" class="link">pricing page.</a>
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </nav>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
